[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
Urghhhhhh...[r]This is revolting.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
Hey, so what happened back then, anyway?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="ちび悪魔"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/72/9.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
You mean with the mirror...? There' no way I'd tell you that.[r]Wait, what's this segment?! What happened to our fight?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya38.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
Eh, don't sweat over the li'l details.[r]Anything goes in this segment.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
So c'mon, Levi~♥[r]Tell meee~ Pleeease~[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="ちび悪魔"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/72/10.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
Tch... Ugh, fine.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya9.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
[font size=25]Yep, he can't say no to me. That part hasn't changed.[resetfont][p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="ちび悪魔"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/72/8.png"  ]
[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya1.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
... I once went to a human country and used my evil eye to sway the hearts of the people.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
But then... I accidentally visibly avoided a mirror that was held up to me.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
This made the people think they could use mirrors to reflect my evil sight back at me.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="ちび悪魔"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/72/9.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
That rumor spread quickly, and they even made protective charms modeled after my evil eye...[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya5.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
Oh yeah, I've seen 'em around Magirisia... A protective charm that looks just like your evil eye? Gross.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="ちび悪魔"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/72/8.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Nazar
Yeah... I break those glass charms whenever I see them. They aggravate me... I'm not actually weak to mirrors.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[chara_mod  name="劇場でび"  time="0"  cross="false"  storage="chara/15/dagya54.png"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#Devilun
Then did ya avoid the mirror 'cause ya hated your reflection or somethin'~?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[keyframe name="akuma"]
[frame p="0%" x="0"]
[frame p="50%" x="-3"]
[frame p="100%" x="0"]
[endkeyframe]
[kanim name="ちび悪魔" keyframe="akuma" count="infinite" time="100" direction="alternate" easing="linear"]
